  "summary": [
    "New **cancel** command: CancelOrder carries the order id and a CancelReason",
    "OrderStatus gains CANCELLED; an order can be cancelled until it is picked up",
    "Order keeps **why** and **when**: cancelReason and cancelledAt",
    "DELETE /orders/{id} on OrderController builds the CancelOrder",
    "Migration V2 adds cancel_reason and cancelled_at to the **orders** table"
  ],
